<%# One chart card on homepage B (#909): a question as its title, a one-line subtitle, the chart, then the source line
    and the link text at the bottom. The whole card is one link. Locals:
    key: the chart (for the analytics), size: :large or :small, url:, title:, short_title: what phones show when the
    title wouldn't fit on one line at 17px (optional), subtitle:, sources: the source line (or nil), link: the link
    text. The block is the chart. %>
<%= link_to url, class: "nd-chart nd-chart--#{size}", data: { home_chart: key } do %>
  <% short = local_assigns[:short_title] if local_assigns[:short_title] != title %>
  <h2 class="nd-chart__title type-title-md"<% if short %> title="<%= title %>"<% end %>><% if short %><span class="nd-chart__tfull"><%= title %></span><span class="nd-chart__tshort"><%= short %></span><% else %><%= title %><% end %></h2>
  <p class="nd-chart__sub type-small"><%= subtitle %></p>
  <div class="nd-chart__body"><%= yield %></div>
  <div class="nd-chart__foot">
    <% if sources %><span class="nd-chart__src type-data-sm"><%= sources %></span><% end %>
    <span class="nd-chart__more type-ui"><%= link %> →</span>
  </div>
<% end %>
